WEBVTT

00:03:26.673 --> 00:03:30.495
for how human beings regarded creativity
for nearly all of human history

00:03:30.519 --> 00:03:34.113
until, basically, the middle
of the 19th century.

00:03:34.137 --> 00:03:39.321
You know, what happened was there was
this really toxic revolution in creativity

00:03:39.345 --> 00:03:42.848
that I like to blame
on the German Romantics

00:03:42.872 --> 00:03:46.014
that put the individual
at the center of the story,

00:03:46.038 --> 00:03:48.953
a very narcissistic version of creativity,

00:03:48.977 --> 00:03:53.107
a very Great Man-based
version of creativity:

00:03:53.131 --> 00:03:54.507
it all came from you,

00:03:54.531 --> 00:03:58.300
it all came from you, from your talent,
from your greatness, from your efforts,

00:03:58.324 --> 00:04:01.191
and, generally speaking,
in a very romanticized way,